  "event_28Oct": "Experimental. Area mapped as mangrove by Global Mangrove Watch (2020 extent), L-band HV minus HH, 28 Oct against the early-October baseline. The size and sign of the difference depend on the reference used (uncorrected +0.0 dB, land-wide corrected -1.9 dB, matched corrected -1.1 dB), so any change cannot be separated from calibration differences between the scenes. No ground truth was used, tide state was not controlled, and the baseline scenes are provisional.",
  "event_9Nov": "Experimental. Area mapped as mangrove by Global Mangrove Watch (2020 extent), L-band HV minus HH, 9 Nov (also contains Murasu and the river peak) against the early-October baseline. The size and sign of the difference depend on the reference used (uncorrected +0.1 dB, land-wide corrected -1.2 dB, matched corrected -0.8 dB), so any change cannot be separated from calibration differences between the scenes. No ground truth was used, tide state was not controlled, and the baseline scenes are provisional."
